sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant EP as Post/CommentEndpoints
    participant VS as VotingService
    participant DB as AppDbContext / PostgreSQL

    U->>EP: PUT /api/posts/{id}/vote {value: +1 | -1}
    EP->>VS: CastVoteAsync(Post, targetId, voterId, value)
    VS->>DB: look up target's author

    alt voter is the author
        VS-->>EP: throws SelfVoteException
        EP-->>U: 400
    else different user
        VS->>DB: upsert Vote(TargetType, TargetId, VoterId, Value)
        VS->>DB: adjust author AppUser.Karma by delta
        DB-->>VS: saved
        VS-->>EP: new score
        EP-->>U: 200 {score, viewerVote}
    end

    U->>EP: DELETE /api/posts/{id}/vote
    EP->>VS: RemoveVoteAsync(Post, targetId, voterId)
    VS->>DB: delete Vote row (no-op if none existed)
    VS->>DB: reverse the karma delta
    EP-->>U: 200 {score}
